   "bbox": [
    69.0,
    482.6,
    525.0,
    577.6
   ],
   "ocr": "Debt due within one year of the December 31, 2016 balance sheet was classified as long-term as the\nCompany has both the intent and ability to refinance current maturities on a long-term basis under its revolving\nsenior credit facilities with the exception that $8 million of MGP’s quarterly amortization payments under its\nsenior credit facility were classified as current because MGP used cash to make such amortization payments in\nJanuary 2017. At December 31, 2015, the amount available under the Company’s revolving senior credit facility\nwas less than current maturities related to the Company’s term loan credit facilities and senior notes. The\nCompany excluded from the December 31, 2015 current portion of long-term debt the amount available for\nrefinancing under its revolving credit facility."
  },
